     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Hi all</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><span lang=\"en\"><span>I come with</span> <span>a</span> <span>problem in</span> <span>shiny</span> <span>server</span> <span>(Ubuntu)</span><span>;</span> <span>my application</span> <span>contains links to</span> <span>documents</span><span>;</span> <span>in the local version</span> <span>there is</span> <span>no problem</span> <span>to open documents</span> <span>(even</span> <span>links to documents</span> <span>included in</span> <span>a</span> <span>datatable</span><span>)</span><span>;</span> <span>I</span> <span>can not</span> <span>open documents</span> <span>in the version</span> <span>in</span> <span>shiny</span><span>-server</span><span>;</span> <span>However</span> <span>I checked</span> <span>the</span> <span>good</span> <span>location</span> <span>of documents</span> <br><br><span>Below</span> <span>the</span> <span>print</span> <span>of my</span> <span>console</span> <span>(</span><span>I noticed</span> <span>a problem with the</span> <span>GET</span> of <span>sockjs</span><span>-</span><span>0.3.min.js)</span> </span><span lang=\"en\"><span lang=\"en\"><span>is what</span> <span>is causing the problem</span><span>?</span> </span><br><span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><span lang=\"en\"><span>Thank you</span> <span>for your ideas</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Alain<br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-PkCtkFdstro/U1TMyaG2aaI/AAAAAAAAA7Y/snjoN3vCr6k/s1600/BugShinyServer_Link.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-PkCtkFdstro/U1TMyaG2aaI/AAAAAAAAA7Y/snjoN3vCr6k/s1600/BugShinyServer_Link.png&amp;source=