     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Jeff<br><br><br><span lang=\"en\"><span title=\"Merci de votre réponse;\">Thank you for your reply ; </span><span title=\"ma version de shiny-server est 0.3.0\r\n\r\n\">my version of shiny -server is 0.3.0<br><br></span><span title=\"J&#39;ai deux examples\r\n\r\n\">I have two examples<br><br></span><span title=\"1) Avec le package hwriter :\r\n\"><b>1) With hwriter package :</b><br><br></span><span title=\"le fichier ALMdashboard20121231.pdf se trouve dans\r\n\"> The file </span></span><span lang=\"en\"><span title=\"le fichier ALMdashboard20121231.pdf se trouve dans\r\n\"><i><u><span lang=\"en\"><span title=\"le fichier ALMdashboard20121231.pdf se trouve dans\r\n\">ALMdashboard20121231.pdf</span></span></u></i> is located in </span><span title=\"/var/shiny-server/www/DashBoard_V4\r\n\r\n\">/ var/shiny-server/www/DashBoard_V4<br><br></span><span title=\"Ce code est présent dans server.R (hwrite du package hwriter)\r\n\r\n\">This code is present in server.R ( function hwrite)<br><br></span><i><span title=\"output$link1 &lt;- renderText({\r\n\">$ link1 output &lt;- renderText ({<br></span><span title=\"lin&lt;-c(&quot;1&quot; = &quot;ORSA 2013&quot;,&quot;2&quot;=&quot;ALM DashBoard&quot;,&quot;3&quot;=&quot;KRI DashBoard&quot;)\r\n\">lin &lt; -c (&quot;1&quot; = &quot; ORSA 2013 &quot;, &quot;2 &quot; = &quot; ALM DashBoard &quot;, &quot;3 &quot; = &quot; KRI DashBoard &quot; )<br></span><span title=\"y &lt;- data.frame(&quot;Key&quot; = names(lin), &quot;Value&quot; = lin)\r\n\">y &lt; - data.frame ( &quot;Key&quot; = names (flax ) , &quot;Value&quot; = lin)<br></span><span title=\"\tnames(y)&lt;-c(&quot;Nr&quot;,&quot;Document&quot;)\r\n\">names ( y) &lt; -c ( &quot; Nr &quot;, &quot; Document&quot;)<br></span><span title=\"\thwrite(y, row.names=FALSE, col.names=TRUE, row.bgcolor=list(&#39;lightgray&#39;),row.style=list(&#39;font-weight:bold&#39;),col.link=list(Document=c(&#39;BI_ORSA_2013_08.pdf&#39;,&#39;ALMdashboard20121231.pdf&#39;,&#39;BI_KRI_DASHBOARD.pdf&#39;)),width\">hwrite\r\n (y, row.names = FALSE , col.names = TRUE , \r\nrow.bgcolor=list(&#39;lightgray&#39;),row.style=list(&#39;font-weight:bold&#39;),col.link=list(Document=c(&#39;BI_ORSA_2013_08.pdf&#39;,&#39;ALMdashboard20121231.pdf&#39;,&#39;BI_KRI_DASHBOARD.pdf&#39;)),width\r\n </span><span title=\"= &quot;50%&quot;)\r\n\">= &quot;50%&quot; )<br></span></i><span title=\"\t})\r\n\r\n\r\n\"><i>} )</i><br><br><br></span><span title=\"En clickant sur le lien je reçois :\r\n\r\n\">While clicking on the link I get :<br><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><span title=\"http://vla:3838/DashBoard_V4/ALMdashboard20121231.pdf\r\n\"><a href=\"http://vla:3838/DashBoard_V4/ALMdashboard20121231.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://vla:3838/DashBoard_V4/ALMdashboard20121231.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403994658000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1UQeOR6JICynFgjCLWtIZj\">http://vla:3838/DashBoard_V4/ALMdashboard20121231.pdf</a><br></span></span><span title=\"Not Found\r\n\r\n\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">not Found</span><br><br></span><span title=\"2) Avec fonction renderDataTable\r\n\r\n\"><b>2) With function renderDataTable</b><br><br></span><span title=\"Un champs de la table s&#39;appelle Link1 et contient les liens\r\n\">A field in a table called Link_1 and contains links<br></span><span title=\"&lt;a target=&#39;_blank&#39; href=&#39;policies\\30_0000_00_HRM_Code Of Conduct.PDF&#39;&gt; Code Of Conduct&lt;/a&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n\">&lt;a target=&#39;_blank&#39; href=&#39;policies\\30_0000_00_HRM_Code Code Of Conduct Of Conduct.PDF&#39;&gt; &lt;/ a&gt;<br><br></span><span title=\"En clickang sur le lient je reçois\r\n\r\n\"></span></span><br><span lang=\"en\"><span title=\"En clickang sur le lient je reçois\r\n\r\n\"><span lang=\"en\"><span title=\"En clickant sur le lien je reçois :\r\n\r\n\">While clicking on the link I get :<br><br></span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><span title=\"http://vla:3838/DashBoard_V4/policies\\30_0000_00_HRM_Code%20Of%20Conduct.PDF\r\n\"><a href=\"http://vla:3838/DashBoard_V4/policies%5C30_0000_00_HRM_Code\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://vla:3838/DashBoard_V4/policies%255C30_0000_00_HRM_Code&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403994658000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0bdLSIVDVKtaF_T-xihduX\">http://vla:3838/DashBoard_V4/policies\\30_0000_00_HRM_Code</a> % 20of% 20Conduct.PDF<br></span><span title=\"Page not found\r\n\">Page not found<br></span></span><span title=\"Sorry, but the page you requested doesn&#39;t exist.\r\n\r\n\r\n\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">Sorry, but the page you Requested does not exist .</span><br><br>In the local version i can open the document in the 2 examples.<br><br></span><span title=\"Merci d&#39;avance de votre aide\">Thank you in advance for your help</span></span></div>"
