     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>On Tuesday, April 22, 2014 5:27:36 PM UTC+2, Jeff Allen wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n<div bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" text=\"#000000\">Interesting. Have you \r\nnoticed this for longer than a week or so? We changed some settings last\r\n week that could effect network connectivity.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThanks,<br>\r\nJeff<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<blockquote style=\"border:0px none\" type=\"cite\">\r\n  <div style=\"margin:30px 25px 10px 25px\"><div style=\"display:table;width:100%;border-top:1px solid #edeef0;padding-top:5px\"> \t   <div style=\"display:table-cell;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:middle;width:100%\">\r\n   \t<a style=\"color:#737f92!important;padding-right:6px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none!important\" rel=\"nofollow\">John Harrison</a></div>   <div style=\"display:table-cell;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:middle\">   \r\n  <font color=\"#9FA2A5\"><span style=\"padding-left:6px\">Tuesday, April \r\n22, 2014 9:40 AM</span></font></div></div></div>\r\n  <div style=\"color:#888888;margin-left:24px;margin-right:24px\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">I have this \r\nproblem at the moment when connecting to spark. <br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-IORU_gyH7dE/U1Z-z2f3sDI/AAAAAAAAAG4/QxeogdURq1M/s1600/Screenshot+2014-04-22+21.36.32.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-IORU_gyH7dE/U1Z-z2f3sDI/AAAAAAAAAG4/QxeogdURq1M/s1600/Screenshot%2B2014-04-22%2B21.36.32.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403994658000&amp;usg=AOvVaw18dmWyTSPBU_jNx1C9lAba\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-IORU_gyH7dE/U1Z-z2f3sDI/AAAAAAAAAG4/QxeogdURq1M/s320/Screenshot+2014-04-22+21.36.32.png\" border=\"0\" height=\"179\" width=\"320\"></a></p>It is ISP related. I get \r\nthis issue in some countries where internet blocking etc. is occurring. \r\nWhen I run a VPN I dont have this issue.<br><br>On Monday, April 21, \r\n2014 3:02:37 PM UTC+7, Alain Vanlanduyt wrote:</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to a topic in the \r\nGoogle Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this topic, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/topic/shiny-discuss/E6e8I0Ne9EI/unsubscribe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/topic/shiny-discuss/E6e8I0Ne9EI/unsubscribe&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403994658000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2xLwsieTxgDnm_T8jEPAg8\">https://groups.google.com/d/topic/shiny-discuss/E6e8I0Ne9EI/unsubscribe</a>.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and all its topics, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403994658000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2AG3d4ncADfoN-KPgCw0aL\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n</blockquote></div>"
