   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n<div bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" text=\"#000000\">Hi Alain,<br>\r\n<br>\r\nUnfortunately, that&#39;s very old software, so I&#39;m not sure what problems \r\nyou&#39;d be seeing. We just this week released Shiny Server 1.1. Shiny is \r\nnow at v.0.9.1. Can you update your installation of Shiny and Shiny \r\nServer to the latest builds and let us know if you&#39;re still having \r\ntrouble?<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"http://www.rstudio.com/shiny/server/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rstudio.com/shiny/server/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403994662000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Scn78ApZJvZGNdwDXzHgl\">http://www.rstudio.com/shiny/server/</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\nThanks,<br>\r\nJeff<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<blockquote style=\"border:0px none\" type=\"cite\">\r\n  <div style=\"margin:30px 25px 10px 25px\"><div style=\"display:table;width:100%;border-top:1px solid #edeef0;padding-top:5px\"> \t   <div style=\"display:table-cell;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:middle;width:100%\">\r\n   \t<a href style=\"color:#737f92!important;padding-right:6px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none!important\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Alain Vanlanduyt</a></div>   <div style=\"display:table-cell;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:middle\">   \r\n  <font color=\"#9FA2A5\"><span style=\"padding-left:6px\">Tuesday, April \r\n22, 2014 2:13 PM</span></font></div></div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" text=\"#000000\"><blockquote style=\"border:0px none\" type=\"cite\">\r\n  <div style=\"color:#888888;margin-left:24px;margin-right:24px\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Jeff<br><br><br><span lang=\"en\"><span title=\"Merci de \r\nvotre réponse;\">Thank you for your reply ; </span><span title=\"ma \r\nversion de shiny-server est 0.3.0\">my version of shiny -server is 0.3.0<br><br></span><span title=\"J&#39;ai deux examples\">I have two examples<br><br></span><span title=\"1) Avec le package hwriter :\"><b>1) With hwriter package :</b><br><br></span><span title=\"le fichier ALMdashboard20121231.pdf se trouve dans\"> The file </span></span><span lang=\"en\"><span title=\"le \r\nfichier ALMdashboard20121231.pdf se trouve dans\"><i><u><span lang=\"en\"><span title=\"le fichier \r\nALMdashboard20121231.pdf se trouve dans\">ALMdashboard20121231.pdf</span></span></u></i>\r\n is located in </span><span title=\"/var/shiny-server/www/DashBoard_V4\">/\r\n var/shiny-server/www/DashBoard_V4<br><br></span><span title=\"Ce code \r\nest présent dans server.R (hwrite du package hwriter)\">This code is \r\npresent in server.R ( function hwrite)<br><br></span><i><span title=\"output$link1 &lt;- renderText({\">$ link1 output &lt;- renderText \r\n({<br></span><span title=\"lin&lt;-c(&quot;1&quot; = &quot;ORSA \r\n2013&quot;,&quot;2&quot;=&quot;ALM \r\nDashBoard&quot;,&quot;3&quot;=&quot;KRI DashBoard&quot;)\">lin &lt; -c \r\n(&quot;1&quot; = &quot; ORSA 2013 &quot;, &quot;2 &quot; = &quot; ALM DashBoard &quot;, &quot;3 &quot; = &quot; KRI DashBoard &quot;\r\n )<br></span><span title=\"y &lt;- data.frame(&quot;Key&quot; = \r\nnames(lin), &quot;Value&quot; = lin)\">y &lt; - data.frame ( &quot;Key&quot; = \r\nnames (flax ) , &quot;Value&quot; = lin)<br></span><span title=\"names(y)&lt;-c(&quot;Nr&quot;,&quot;Document&quot;)\">names ( y) \r\n&lt; -c ( &quot; Nr &quot;, &quot; Document&quot;)<br></span><span title=\"hwrite(y, \r\nrow.names=FALSE, col.names=TRUE, \r\nrow.bgcolor=list(&#39;lightgray&#39;),row.style=list(&#39;font-weight:bold&#39;),col.link=list(Document=c(&#39;BI_ORSA_2013_08.pdf&#39;,&#39;ALMdashboard20121231.pdf&#39;,&#39;BI_KRI_DASHBOARD.pdf&#39;)),width\">hwrite\r\n\r\n (y, row.names = FALSE , col.names = TRUE , \r\nrow.bgcolor=list(&#39;lightgray&#39;),row.style=list(&#39;font-weight:bold&#39;),col.link=list(Document=c(&#39;BI_ORSA_2013_08.pdf&#39;,&#39;ALMdashboard20121231.pdf&#39;,&#39;BI_KRI_DASHBOARD.pdf&#39;)),width\r\n\r\n </span><span title=\"= &quot;50%&quot;)\">= &quot;50%&quot; )<br></span></i><span title=\"})\"><i>} )</i><br><br><br></span><span title=\"En clickant sur le \r\nlien je reçois :\">While clicking on the link I get :<br><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><span title=\"http://vla:3838/DashBoard_V4/ALMdashboard20121231.pdf\"><a href=\"http://vla:3838/DashBoard_V4/ALMdashboard20121231.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://vla:3838/DashBoard_V4/ALMdashboard20121231.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403994662000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2mLsQ-lKPoX0XxTO_8EuXR\">http://vla:3838/DashBoard_V4/ALMdashboard20121231.pdf</a><br></span></span><span title=\"Not Found\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">not Found</span><br><br></span><span title=\"2) Avec fonction renderDataTable\"><b>2) With function \r\nrenderDataTable</b><br><br></span><span title=\"Un champs de la table \r\ns&#39;appelle Link1 et contient les liens\">A field in a table called Link_1 \r\nand contains links<br></span><span title=\"&lt;a target=&#39;_blank&#39; \r\nhref=&#39;policies\\30_0000_00_HRM_Code Of Conduct.PDF&#39;&gt; Code Of \r\nConduct&lt;/a&gt;\">&lt;a target=&#39;_blank&#39; \r\nhref=&#39;policies\\30_0000_00_HRM_Code Code Of Conduct Of Conduct.PDF&#39;&gt; \r\n&lt;/ a&gt;<br><br></span><span title=\"En clickang sur le lient je \r\nreçois\"></span></span><br><span lang=\"en\"><span title=\"En clickang sur le lient je reçois\"><span lang=\"en\"><span title=\"En \r\nclickant sur le lien je reçois :\">While clicking on the link I get :<br><br></span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><span title=\"http://vla:3838/DashBoard_V4/policies\\30_0000_00_HRM_Code%20Of%20Conduct.PDF\"><a href=\"http://vla:3838/DashBoard_V4/policies%5C30_0000_00_HRM_Code\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://vla:3838/DashBoard_V4/policies%255C30_0000_00_HRM_Code&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403994662000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2OtTJC8Td981ex6GAxjUMS\">http://vla:3838/DashBoard_V4/policies\\30_0000_00_HRM_Code</a>\r\n % 20of% 20Conduct.PDF<br></span><span title=\"Page not found\">Page not \r\nfound<br></span></span><span title=\"Sorry, but the page you requested \r\ndoesn&#39;t exist.\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">Sorry, but the page\r\n you Requested does not exist .</span><br><br>In the local version i can\r\n open the document in the 2 examples.<br><br></span><span title=\"Merci \r\nd&#39;avance de votre aide\">Thank you in advance for your help</span></span><br><br>On\r\n Tuesday, April 22, 2014 5:27:36 PM UTC+2, Jeff Allen wrote:</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to a topic in the \r\nGoogle Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this topic, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/topic/shiny-discuss/E6e8I0Ne9EI/unsubscribe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/topic/shiny-discuss/E6e8I0Ne9EI/unsubscribe&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403994662000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0UJ0PkXjrFZmtz9aqCRsww\">https://groups.google.com/d/topic/shiny-discuss/E6e8I0Ne9EI/unsubscribe</a>.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and all its topics, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.goo